      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::004::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf addition should be minor and controlled.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf addition increases lattice distortion in W–Ta–Cr–V.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The increased lattice distortion provides additional solid-solution strengthening.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf may promote a fine dispersion of nanoscale precipitates or other nanoscale features.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-associated nanoscale features impede dislocation motion and inhibit irradiation-defect clustering.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding Hf increases entropic stabilization of the alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf addition produces a more homogeneous microstructure with sluggish defect kinetics.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-induced lattice distortion hinders dislocation motion without causing adverse phase segregation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-containing quinary alloy will have higher yield strength than baseline W–Ta–Cr–V.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-containing quinary alloy will have improved overall mechanical performance relative to baseline W–Ta–Cr–V.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::004::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
